OL,3,GNEWSADUP will 'not be found wanting'
OL,4,Awhen it comes to unionist co-operation,
OL,5,Asays Robinson
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Democratic Unionist Party (DUP)
OL,8,Fwill "not be found wanting" when it
OL,9,Fcomes to co-operating with other
OL,10,Funionist parties to maximise the
OL,11,Fpro-union vote in next year's
OL,12,Felections, Gavin Robinson has said.
OL,14,FThe DUP leader was giving his annual
OL,15,Fconference speech ahead of highly
OL,16,Fanticipated assembly and council
OL,17,Felections next May.
OL,19,FRobinson told his conference that the
OL,20,Fparty "must not gift wrap seats to Sinn
OL,21,FFein, the SDLP or Alliance that we
OL,22,Fcould otherwise win".
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
